# apps/mobile has BOTH package-lock.json and pnpm-lock.yaml. EAS builds from
# the pnpm one and uploads only git-tracked files, so committing the npm
# lockfile puts a second, competing lockfile in the build tree - which has
# already once produced an APK that silently shipped without its native
# module. Keep it local. .npmrc is the matching local npm convenience.
apps/mobile/package-lock.json
apps/mobile/.npmrc

# Mobile build artefacts
*.aab
*.apk
*.ipa

